<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pemex details Q2 crude prices.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex details Q2 crude prices.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's state oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) reported its Q2 average prices for crude exports by region and brand. Figures in dollars per barrel.</p>
<p>    Item		 Q2 1997    Pct change from Q2 '96</p>
<p>  Export Basket	  15.83		-11.5</p>
<p>    Olmeca		 18.60		 -9.7</p>
<p>    Isthmus		17.22		 -8.8</p>
<p>    Maya		   14.16		-12.5</p>
<p>  Western Hemisphere   16.14		-11.6</p>
<p>    Olmeca		 18.52		 -9.7</p>
<p>    Isthmus		17.49		-12.8</p>
<p>    Maya		   14.56		-12.2</p>
<p>  Europe		   13.18		-11.7</p>
<p>    Isthmus		15.74		-11.6</p>
<p>    Maya		   12.57		-14.6</p>
<p>  Asia		     17.81		  0.2</p>
<p>    Isthmus		18.14		  1.6</p>
<p>    Maya		   15.50		  2.1</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
</text>
